# promql-validator requires NO environment variables to build, test, or run.
#
# The package makes zero network requests on its own (see README.md "Privacy"). If you
# wire up your own `suggestionProvider` against a real metrics backend, any credentials
# that requires belong in *your* application's environment configuration, not here.
#
# This file exists only as a documented placeholder so tooling that expects a .env.example
# to be present (and CI checks that scan for one) find one — there is nothing to fill in.
